cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DAIMO, please cite this repository and the accompanying paper."
title: "DAIMO: An ontology for managing AI models in data spaces"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-04-03
authors:
  - family-names: "de Elvira Mori Orrillo"
    given-names: "Edmundo"
    email: "edmundo.mori.orrillo@upm.es"
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Jiayun"
abstract: >-
  DAIMO is an ontology for representing AI models as governed assets in data spaces.
  It connects publication metadata, policy constraints, invocation contracts,
  runtime requirements, execution traces, evaluation contexts, audit artifacts,
  and reproducibility artifacts.
keywords:
  - ontology
  - AI models
  - data spaces
  - semantic interoperability
  - SHACL
  - reproducibility
